{"manifest_version": 3, "name": "Snap Tab \u2013 Save Visible Page as PNG", "version": "1.0.0", "description": "Ch\u1ee5p \u1ea3nh v\u00f9ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u1ee7a tab hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i v\u00e0 l\u01b0u v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y (PNG). C\u00f3 n\u00fat trong popup v\u00e0 menu chu\u1ed9t ph\u1ea3i.", "icons": {"16": "icons/icon-16.png", "32": "icons/icon-32.png", "48": "icons/icon-48.png", "128": "icons/icon-128.png"}, "action": {"default_popup": "popup.html", "default_icon": {"16": "icons/icon-16.png", "32": "icons/icon-32.png"}}, "permissions": ["activeTab", "tabs", "downloads", "contextMenus"], "background": {"scripts": ["background.js"]}, "browser_specific_settings": {"gecko": {"id": "snap-tab-demo@example.com", "strict_min_version": "109.0"}}}